{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Before</b>, <b>good</b> — two words joined." "<b>Height of spirit</b> — therefore it is good to be lowly of spirit, to be among the humble." "<b>Divides</b> — a portion in the portion of spoil, with the proud, for then he will break like them, being an oppressor."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:08.830426899Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}